Title: November 2026 Election

URL Source: https://www.austintexas.gov/clerk/november-2026-election

Markdown Content:
All information on this webpage is specific to the November 2026 City of Austin Election and Campaign Finance Filing Requirements. We will continually update information as we approach the November 2026 Election. Please contact[Elections@austintexas.gov](http://www.austintexas.gov/email/elections)with any election related questions.

Election Day is November 3, 2026; the 78th day before that election date is August 17, 2026. Therefore, the first day for filing is the 30th day preceding August 17, 2026, that being Saturday, July 18, 2026. Since the Clerk’s office is closed on non-business days, the **first day to file an application in person is Monday, July 20, 2026**.

** Regular business hours for the Austin City Clerk's Office are Monday - Friday, 8 a.m. to 5 p.m. The filing location is the Austin City Clerk's Office, 301 W. Second St., Suite 2030, Austin, Texas 78701; fax number (512) 974-2374; email address is [elections@austintexas.gov](https://www.austintexas.gov/email/elections). **APPOINTMENTS ARE HIGHLY ENCOURAGED**. **PLEASE CHECK IN AT THE SECURITY DESK ON THE FIRST FLOOR OF CITY HALL.**

